  "notes": "AccessGUDID (NLM) /api/v3/devices/lookup?di= returns the GUDID record as JSON. GUDID is the upstream database that openFDA /device/udi.json re-publishes: the same DI yields the same publicDeviceRecordKey on both interfaces, so they are ONE evidence item, not two. GUDID publish_date is a real per-record first-publication date; public_version_date is a version stamp and must never be used as the first-publication date.",
